Subject: [PATCH] fix(sosyal-medya): temporarily hide Threads card pending
 Zernio Meta App fix
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Threads OAuth connect never completes on Meta's side (client_id 1410550293434390
lands users on threads.net's generic signup screen instead of an app consent
dialog). Root cause is on Zernio's Meta App configuration, not our code —
reported to Zernio support. Hiding the Threads card to avoid a confusing silent
failure for users until Zernio confirms a fix.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
